"Connect your personal Outlook account using OAuth. \n"
"You will be redirected to the Outlook login page to accept the permissions."
msgstr ""
"Povežite svoj osebni račun Outlook z uporabo OAuth. Preusmerjeni boste na "
"prijavno stran Outlooka, kjer boste potrdili dovoljenja."

